  - name: annotate1
    mode: annotate
    title: Bundesbank API fetch + cleaning
    text: Fetch pulse -> webclient_bbk (async GET, CSV) -> callbacks hand the body to SeriesSynthExt -> raw_csv. clean_series keeps YYYY-MM rows with finite numbers (date, year, month, t, value_meur, value_bn); stats_series derives the descriptive statistics.
    position: [130, -590]
    size: [1870, 850]
    color: [0.12, 0.22, 0.32]
- name: out1
  type: outTOP
  flags:
  - display
  position: [1400, 0]
  inputs:
  - viz
- name: engine
  type: baseCOMP
  position: [600, 0]
  inputs:
  - data
  children:
  - name: lfo_gate
    type: lfoCHOP
    parameters:
      wavetype: ramp
      channelname: gate
      rate: =me.time.rate
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position: [200, -1800]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
  - name: math_vca
    type: mathCHOP
    parameters:
      chopop: mul
      gain: =parent.Synth.par.Volume
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position: [3400, -2600]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    inputs:
    - audiofilter_vcf
    - trigger_amp
  - name: null_env
    type: nullCHOP
    position: [2200, -1800]
    inputs:
    - trail_env
  - name: expr_gate
    type: expressionCHOP
    sequences:
      expr:
      - expr: =float(max((me.inputVal < parent.Synth.par.Gatelength) * parent.Synth.par.Autogate, parent.Synth.par.Gate, parent.Synth.par.Hold))
    position: [600, -1800]
    inputs:
    - lfo_gate
  - name: in_series
    type: inDAT
    parameters:
      label: =me.name
    position: [200, 0]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    dat_read_only: true
  - name: lag_glide
    type: lagCHOP
    parameters:
      lag1: =parent.Synth.par.Glide
      lag2: =parent.Synth.par.Glide
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position: [1800, -2600]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    inputs:
    - select_pitch
  - name: limit_out
    type: limitCHOP
    parameters:
      type: clamp
      autoexportroot: =parent()
      renameto: audio
    position: [3800, -2600]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    inputs:
    - math_vca
  - name: merge_env
    type: mergeCHOP
    position: [1400, -1800]
    inputs:
    - expr_gate
    - trigger_amp
    - trigger_filt
  - name: trail_env
    type: trailCHOP
    position: [1800, -1800]
    inputs:
    - merge_env
  - name: null_audio
    type: nullCHOP
    position: [4200, -2600]
    inputs:
    - limit_out
  - name: null_scope
    type: nullCHOP
    position: [5800, -3800]
    inputs:
    - script_scope
  - name: speed_scan
    type: speedCHOP
    parameters:
      max: 100000
    position: [600, -400]
    inputs:
    - const_scanrate
  - name: analyze_rms
    type: analyzeCHOP
    parameters:
      function: rmspower
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position: [5400, -3400]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    inputs:
    - null_audio
  - name: expr_cutoff
    type: expressionCHOP
    parameters:
      renameto: cutofffrequency
    sequences:
      expr:
      - expr: =min(18000.0, max(20.0, parent.Synth.par.Cutoff * 2.0 ** (parent.Synth.par.Envamount * me.inputVal)))
    position: [1400, -2200]
    inputs:
    - trigger_filt
  - name: lookup_wave
    type: lookupCHOP
    parameters:
      index1: -1
      cyclic: 'yes'
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position: [2600, -2600]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    inputs:
    - audioosc_phase
    - select_table
  - name: merge_scope
    type: mergeCHOP
    position: [4600, -3800]
    inputs:
    - null_audio
    - audioosc_phase
  - name: null_frames
    type: nullCHOP
    position: [2200, 0]
    inputs:
    - script_frames
  - name: null_series
    type: nullCHOP
    position: [1000, 0]
    inputs:
    - datto_series
  - name: trail_scope
    type: trailCHOP
    parameters:
      wlength: 8192
      wlengthunit: samples
    position: [5000, -3800]
    inputs:
    - merge_scope
  - name: trigger_amp
    type: triggerCHOP
    parameters:
      attack: =parent.Synth.par.Attack
      decay: =parent.Synth.par.Decay
      sustain: =parent.Synth.par.Sustain
      release: =parent.Synth.par.Release
      channame: ampenv
      renameto: ampenv
    position: [1000, -1800]
    inputs:
    - expr_gate
  - name: datto_series
    type: dattoCHOP
    parameters:
      dat: in_series
      extractcols: bynames
      colnames: t value_bn
      firstcolumn: values
    position: [600, 0]
  - name: script_scope
    type: scriptCHOP
    parameters:
      callbacks: script_scope_callbacks
    position: [5400, -3800]
    inputs:
    - trail_scope
  - name: select_pitch
    type: selectCHOP
    parameters:
      channames: hz
    position: [1400, -2600]
    inputs:
    - script_window
  - name: select_table
    type: selectCHOP
    parameters:
      channames: shaped
    position: [2200, -400]
    inputs:
    - null_wavetable
  - name: trigger_filt
    type: triggerCHOP
    parameters:
      attack: =parent.Synth.par.Fattack
      decay: =parent.Synth.par.Fdecay
      sustain: =parent.Synth.par.Fsustain
      release: =parent.Synth.par.Frelease
      channame: filtenv
      renameto: filtenv
    position: [1000, -2200]
    inputs:
    - expr_gate
  - name: null_spectrum
    type: nullCHOP
    position: [5000, -3400]
    inputs:
    - audiospectrum_out
  - name: script_frames
    type: scriptCHOP
    parameters:
      callbacks: script_frames_callbacks
    position: [1800, 0]
  - name: script_window
    type: scriptCHOP
    parameters:
      callbacks: script_window_callbacks
    position: [1000, -400]
    inputs:
    - speed_scan
  - name: wavetable_lib
    type: textDAT
    parameters:
      file: project1/series_synth/engine/wavetable_lib.py
      syncfile: true
      language: python
    position: [1400, 0]
    color: [0.9, 0.3, 0.4]
    tags:
    - py
  - name: audioosc_phase
    type: audiooscillatorCHOP
    parameters:
      wavetype: ramp
      frequency: =op('lag_glide')['hz']
      autoexportroot: =parent()
      renamefrom: chan1
      renameto: phase
    position: [2200, -2600]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
  - name: const_scanrate
    type: constantCHOP
    sequences:
      const:
      - name: rate
        value: =parent.Synth.par.Scanrate * parent.Synth.par.Scan
    position: [200, -400]
  - name: null_harmonics
    type: nullCHOP
    position: [2600, -800]
    inputs:
    - script_harmonics
  - name: null_wavetable
    type: nullCHOP
    position: [1800, -400]
    inputs:
    - script_wavetable
  - name: audiofilter_vcf
    type: audiofilterCHOP
    parameters:
      filter: =parent.Synth.par.Filtertype
      units: frequency
      cutofflog: 2.69897
      cutofffrequency: =parent.Synth.par.Cutoff
      resonance: =parent.Synth.par.Resonance
      rolloff: =float(parent.Synth.par.Rolloff.eval())
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position: [3000, -2600]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    inputs:
    - lookup_wave
    - expr_cutoff
  - name: audiodevout_main
    type: audiodeviceoutCHOP
    parameters:
      active: =parent.Synth.par.Audio
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position: [4600, -2600]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    inputs:
    - null_audio
  - name: script_harmonics
    type: scriptCHOP
    parameters:
      callbacks: script_harmonics_callbacks
    position: [2200, -800]
    inputs:
    - null_wavetable
  - name: script_wavetable
    type: scriptCHOP
    parameters:
      callbacks: script_wavetable_callbacks
    position: [1400, -400]
    inputs:
    - script_window
  - name: audiospectrum_out
    type: audiospectrumCHOP
    parameters:
      frequencylog: 0
      highfreqboost: 0
      outputmenu: setmanually
      outlength: 8192
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position: [4600, -3400]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    inputs:
    - null_audio
  - name: script_scope_callbacks
    type: textDAT
    parameters:
      file: project1/series_synth/engine/script_scope_callbacks.py
      syncfile: true
      language: python
    flags:
    - viewer
    position: [5400, -3920]
    color: [0.9, 0.3, 0.4]
    tags:
    - py
    dock: script_scope
  - name: script_frames_callbacks
    type: textDAT
    parameters:
      file: project1/series_synth/engine/script_frames_callbacks.py
      syncfile: true
      language: python
    flags:
    - viewer
    position: [1800, -120]
    color: [0.9, 0.3, 0.4]
    tags:
    - py
    dock: script_frames
  - name: script_window_callbacks
    type: textDAT
    parameters:
      file: project1/series_synth/engine/script_window_callbacks.py
      syncfile: true
      language: python
    flags:
    - viewer
    position: [1000, -520]
    color: [0.9, 0.3, 0.4]
    tags:
    - py
    dock: script_window
  - name: script_harmonics_callbacks
    type: textDAT
    parameters:
      file: project1/series_synth/engine/script_harmonics_callbacks.py
      syncfile: true
      language: python
    flags:
    - viewer
    position: [2200, -920]
    color: [0.9, 0.3, 0.4]
    tags:
    - py
    dock: script_harmonics
  - name: script_wavetable_callbacks
    type: textDAT
    parameters:
      file: project1/series_synth/engine/script_wavetable_callbacks.py
      syncfile: true
      language: python
    flags:
    - viewer
    position: [1400, -520]
    color: [0.9, 0.3, 0.4]
    tags:
    - py
    dock: script_wavetable
  annotations:
  - name: annotate1
    mode: annotate
    title: 'Wavetable: series window -> single cycle (numpy)'
    text: speed_scan slides the window (Scan); script_window resolves start/length/pitch; script_wavetable builds the 2048-sample cycle via wavetable_lib (detrend, loop, interpolate, shape, band-limit). script_frames builds the 3D frame stack (NUM_FRAMES windows), script_harmonics the harmonic spectrum.
    position: [130, -990]
    size: [2670, 1250]
    color: [0.08, 0.26, 0.28]
  - name: annotate2
    mode: annotate
    title: 'Voice: gate, ADSR x2, oscillator, filter, VCA, audio out'
    text: lfo_gate/expr_gate = auto + manual gate; trigger_amp / trigger_filt are the loudness and filter ADSRs (960 Hz); expr_cutoff = Cutoff * 2^(EnvAmount*env) into the filter's modulation input. audioosc_phase ramp -> lookup_wave reads the table -> audiofilter_vcf -> math_vca (x amp env, x Volume) -> limit_out (+/-1) -> audio device.
    position: [130, -2670]
    size: [4670, 1130]
    color: [0.27, 0.12, 0.27]
  - name: annotate3
    mode: annotate
    title: 'Analysis: spectrum + synced scope'
    text: 'audiospectrum_out: 8192-pt FFT, one sample per Hz (0-22050). script_scope cuts the last two whole cycles from trail_scope using the oscillator phase, so the trace is trigger-stable.'
    position: [4530, -3990]
    size: [1470, 850]
    color: [0.28, 0.22, 0.08]
- name: parexec_synth
  type: parameterexecuteDAT
  parameters:
    fromop: =parent()
    op: ..
    pars: '*'
    builtin: false
    file: project1/series_synth/parexec_synth.py
    syncfile: true
  position: [600, 800]
  size: [130, 90]
  color: [0.9, 0.3, 0.4]
  tags:
  - py
- name: SeriesSynthExt
  type: textDAT
  parameters:
    file: project1/series_synth/SeriesSynthExt.py
    syncfile: true
    language: python
  position: [200, 800]
  color: [0.9, 0.3, 0.4]
  tags:
  - py
annotations:
- name: annotate1
  mode: annotate
  title: Control
  text: SeriesSynthExt owns the parameter schema and the API request (Fetch); parexec_synth routes parameter pulses/changes to _on<Par> handlers.
  position: [130, 730]
  size: [670, 330]
  color: [0.2, 0.2, 0.28]
- name: annotate2
  mode: annotate
  title: 'Pipeline: data -> engine -> viz'
  text: 'data: API fetch + cleaning + statistics. engine: wavetable DSP, voice (gate, ADSR x2, oscillator, filter, VCA, audio out), analysis. viz: textures, 3D scene, labels and the dashboard shader -> out1.'
  position: [130, -70]
  size: [1470, 370]
  color: [0.08, 0.2, 0.28]
